{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/infernal-exalted/1390714-what-would-a-nation-state-under-attack-by-an-infernal-look-like","id":1390714,"title":"What would a nation-state under attack by an infernal look like?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Infernal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-21T23:35:33-07:00","id":1390714,"title":"What would a nation-state under attack by an infernal look like?","content":"Infernal with cecylenian charms for training and background granting, with ebon-dragon charms that allow rot, disguise, and corruption. Against a modern nation-state.<br /> <br /> Brainstorming. <br /> <br /> First of all is the corruption. Good god, the corruption. Paperwork constantly gets lost, misplaced, or misfiled. Morale is down the toilet, as governmental workers and law enforcement and everyone in charge of making things work force their way through a malaise of disheartening and despair. There are pay cuts, scandals, and whatnot, shattering the trust in government. People fuck up, and a series of disasters, either from terrorist attacks, lack of maintenance, and whatever else occur. <br /> <br /> Divides and schisms in the social fabric flare up, whether via religion, ethnicity, class, skin colour, or politics. Where the fuck did all these guys come from, and how the fuck are they so successful is a question. But the results are clear. They are rich, they have connections to local law enforcement, and they are charismatic and clever. Their appearance heralds the death knell of societal unity, as they speak poison into the airwaves and onto blog pages, setting off a firestorm of controversy and terrorism as people, inspired by their words, seek to destroy their perceived enemies. People are now suspicious of their neighbours, every interaction with one hand behind them holding a knife. <br /> <br /> A fight breaks out. Then a riot. Then, it becomes something more. Guns and weapons are brought out. The military is brought in to bring order, and fucks it up. Maybe the commander is a stooge, or maybe because a subordinate misinterpreted their order, or because someone was smuggling in heavy weapons. Either way, it is a massacre that permanently breaks any respect or trust in people's higher authority. People no longer have any sense of nationality.... or they do have a sense of nationality, and think that those fucks in the capital are people who need to be overthrown. Either way, extremist sentiments flare up, and like all extremists, they begin fighting. <br /> <br /> Fire spreads, and the destruction of social services means no one puts them out. There is a pandemic, and the breakdown in coordination means that there is no working quarantine. People bring out weapons, and begin killing, and the lack of military and police means that no one stops them. A full blown civil war starts up, between a dozen or so different factions, with a new warlord rising up each time there is a lull in the fighting. <br /> <br /> And then, someone manages to sneak out some nuclear weapons from long-defunct and abandoned nuclear facilities. Some detonate, and a dozen cities know what it is like to have atomic fire inside of them. The breakdown is complete, and the entire nation breaks apart with no hope of reconciliation. <br /> <br /> What do you think? <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-22T00:24:12-07:00","id":1390720,"title":"","content":"Why is the Infernal attacking a modern nation-state? What is his goal? Is he a citizen? Is he even from Earth? Do they know he\u2019s at war with them? <br /> <br /> I expect that will do more to shape the appearance of the results than strictly which Cecelyne/Ebon Dragon Charms he\u2019s taken.<br /> <br /> (Not that Infernals will even use Yozi Charms in 3e. And in 2e Exalted Modern, the Infernals were the ones running everything, with the return of the Solars and emergence of the Abyssals set to upset that careful balance.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 05-22-2020, 03:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-22T01:45:04-07:00","id":1390730,"title":"","content":"If he/she just wants to take over, after all, it'll be pretty easy, in a democracy, to find someone who wishes their way into high office, probably a whole cabinet of them, and then the whole government is indebted to the Infernal. No civil war necessary.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-22T07:12:59-07:00","id":1390766,"title":"","content":"Is this something your Solar Medicine girl will try to fix? Or... A brainstorm for an unconnected idea or what?<br /> <br /> If I had the Yozi powers of my 2E Infernal... I wouldn't make war on any modern nation-state. I'd buy a mansion some place and live a life of depraved luxury.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-22T08:13:28-07:00","id":1390774,"title":"","content":"Wholesale devastation seems like a rather 2e take. 3e Infernals are slated to be the saviours from Hell, spreading the gospel of their patrons.<br /> <br /> I think I'd have the Infernal setup that same chaos, but then use it to take control of the society rather than destroy it. Expose the mundane corruption, and replace it with divine, hellborne corruption with no equal, which nobody can fight and nobody even cares to, because everyone feels like they are profiteering from it somehow.<br /> <br /> The Infernal takes the biggest cut and lives a life of depraved luxury, but why wouldn't he? Everyone is content within the rainbow of corruption he's spread over the nation, or has been convinced they would be worse off without it. For such is the greatness bestowed upon those favored by the Lords of Hell.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-22T08:23:29-07:00","id":1390776,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/infernal-exalted/1390714-what-would-a-nation-state-under-attack-by-an-infernal-look-like?p=1390766#post1390766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is this something your Solar Medicine girl will try to fix? Or... A brainstorm for an unconnected idea or what?<br /> <br /> If I had the Yozi powers of my 2E Infernal... I wouldn't make war on any modern nation-state. I'd buy a mansion some place and live a life of depraved luxury.</div> </div> </div> </div>Brainstorm. Somewhat connected. Alternate reality has a megacorp that has taken over everything and is basically that horrible megacorporation you see in those sci-fi dystopias. Until one of their victims got an infernal exaltation while awaiting 're-education'. <br /> <br /> The girl's people were in indentured servitude, and used to be a bunch of natives owning land that the corp wanted. So now they're slaves, with their contracts signed in the name of the corporation. <br /> <br /> It took the girl a year to turn the corporation into dust and wind. This brainstorming is just for me to write down what she can potentially do to a nation-state that has pissed her off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-25T21:05:21-07:00","id":1391619,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/infernal-exalted/1390714-what-would-a-nation-state-under-attack-by-an-infernal-look-like?p=1390730#post1390730\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If he/she just wants to take over, after all, it'll be pretty easy, in a democracy, to find someone who wishes their way into high office, probably a whole cabinet of them, and then the whole government is indebted to the Infernal. No civil war necessary.</div> </div> </div> </div>We see what a modern democracy governed by people compromised by being beholden to the interests of others function like.<br /> <br /> Dangerous, but still stymied by courts, by parliaments, by watchdogs, by civil servants who unenthusiastically implement policies, by whistleblowers, and by protests of the people. The Infernals fight has only begun.<br /> <br /> Also, their payment can't take any longer than a month to provide, and has to be a single discrete task.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-25T23:01:29-07:00","id":1391636,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/infernal-exalted/1390714-what-would-a-nation-state-under-attack-by-an-infernal-look-like?p=1391619#post1391619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> We see what a modern democracy governed by people compromised by being beholden to the interests of others function like.<br /> <br /> Dangerous, but still stymied by courts, by parliaments, by watchdogs, by civil servants who unenthusiastically implement policies, by whistleblowers, and by protests of the people. The Infernals fight has only begun.<br /> <br /> Also, their payment can't take any longer than a month to provide, and has to be a single discrete task.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which makes one wonders what happens when one mixes in featly acknowledging audience and asking that favor to be swearing loyalty to the infernal in question...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-26T01:19:37-07:00","id":1391643,"title":"","content":"Doesn't look all that compatible, really. Agreeing to serve someone isn't discrete.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-26T06:40:16-07:00","id":1391671,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/infernal-exalted/1390714-what-would-a-nation-state-under-attack-by-an-infernal-look-like?p=1391643#post1391643\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Doesn't look all that compatible, really. Agreeing to serve someone isn't discrete.</div> </div> </div> </div>Forgive me if I'm wrong, but doesn't the charm 'acknowledgement of fealty' let you brand a warning glyph on anyone that swears loyalty to you in your presence, irregardless of whether or not they actually meant it? They can just put the favour as 'loudly proclaim loyalty to me'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-26T06:49:30-07:00","id":1391673,"title":"","content":"Their sincerity is not what I am disputing. Its compatibility with the requirement of being a single discrete act is. It\u2019s the same reasoning as task-binding a demon to serve Larry\u2019s will in all things is an invalid binding.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-26T06:52:51-07:00","id":1391674,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/infernal-exalted/1390714-what-would-a-nation-state-under-attack-by-an-infernal-look-like?p=1391673#post1391673\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Their sincerity is not what I am disputing. Its compatibility with the requirement of being a single discrete act is. It\u2019s the same reasoning as task-binding a demon to serve Larry\u2019s will in all things is an invalid binding.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm.... Maybe we should take this to the 'ask questions' thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-26T08:51:58-07:00","id":1391687,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/infernal-exalted/1390714-what-would-a-nation-state-under-attack-by-an-infernal-look-like?p=1391673#post1391673\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Their sincerity is not what I am disputing. Its compatibility with the requirement of being a single discrete act is. It\u2019s the same reasoning as task-binding a demon to serve Larry\u2019s will in all things is an invalid binding.</div> </div> </div> </div>Bestowal of Cursed Fortune means you can grant someone social standing, and in return they owe you one, discrete, task.<br /> <br /> An example of one discrete task is that they swear loyalty to you.<br /> <br /> Once they half-heartedly swear loyalty to you, their duty under Bestowal of Cursed Fortune is completely discharged, and they can immediately betray you. <br /> <br /> But... Fealty-Acknowledging Audience can be used whenever someone professes loyalty to you -- even if it's not sincere.<br /> <br /> The combo definitely works.<br /> <br /> (You can't just use Bestowal of Cursed Fortune to get life-long loyalty, but you can absolutely use it to get someone to utter a specific phrase in your presence one time.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 05-26-2020, 11:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-26T09:36:17-07:00","id":1391695,"title":"","content":"I find that ought to get the Orichalcum Rule.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-27T11:49:39-07:00","id":1392010,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/infernal-exalted/1390714-what-would-a-nation-state-under-attack-by-an-infernal-look-like?p=1391695#post1391695\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I find that ought to get the Orichalcum Rule.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why?<br /> <br /> Y'all realise the consequence of breaking the oath is that you take 2L?<br /> <br /> You think that Celestial Exalted who have invested in 7 Malfean Charms and 5 Cecyline Charms should be stopped by ST fiat from inflicting 2L on some mortals?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-27T13:43:55-07:00","id":1392036,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/infernal-exalted/1390714-what-would-a-nation-state-under-attack-by-an-infernal-look-like?p=1392010#post1392010\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why?</div> </div> </div> </div>Mostly a sense that it derailed the central narrative of the wish Charms and was too gamey, but your reminder of the consequences of oath breaking are a compelling reassurance.<br /> <br /> Although they also weaken the argument for the wish granting effectively granting an Infernal total control. Really, cashing your chit for that purpose seems like a drastically wasted opportunity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-27T14:32:16-07:00","id":1392048,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/infernal-exalted/1390714-what-would-a-nation-state-under-attack-by-an-infernal-look-like?p=1392036#post1392036\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Mostly a sense that it derailed the central narrative of the wish Charms and was too gamey, but your reminder of the consequences of oath breaking are a compelling reassurance.<br /> <br /> Although they also weaken the argument for the wish granting effectively granting an Infernal total control. Really, cashing your chit for that purpose seems like a drastically wasted opportunity.</div> </div> </div> </div>It also instills an Intimacy. And the key to any Infernal Wish Granter is to keep them coming back for more.<br /> <br /> You want to grant a wish that makes the mark want to wish again. And introduce to to their friends.<br /> <br /> I absolutely think it's fine for an Infernal to get their hooks in someone with a wish, then use other Charms to cement that grip.<br /> <br /> (That's basically how the 3E Social Influence system is structured.)<br /> <br /> You grant a wish, get a favour.<br /> Turn that favour into a pledge of loyalty.<br /> Now the mortal has a choice: take the broken arm and be done; live loyal to you; or ask for more wishes, digging themselves deeper.<br /> You should be leaning on that Intimacy either way. Maybe offer your new friend some rainbow coloured candy.<br /> <br /> Infernals are Mephistopheles handing out rope. They're dealers working to get people hooked. They're Rumplestiltskin. They're not friendly genis handing out favours and cashing in chits. You are definitely supposed to play smart to get the most bang for your buck, and part of that is to combo your charms together, and part of it is using Social Combat, and part of it is to use trickery and guile to force your mark into an impossible position.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-27T14:43:15-07:00","id":1392053,"title":"","content":"Still more complicated than what Wizard proposed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-27T14:49:10-07:00","id":1392055,"title":"","content":"A fair point, and I was perhaps being too simplistic.<br /> <br /> But then, I think you can be in control even if you don't have total control, if you've got a specific aim you want. Arguably, for example, Britain is controlled by the Old Boys' Network, but it's not like they have <i>total </i>control.<br /> <br /> So I guess the question comes back to this: What does this Infernal actually want to achieve? Why are they attacking this country? What's their goal?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-28T00:46:59-07:00","id":1392143,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/infernal-exalted/1390714-what-would-a-nation-state-under-attack-by-an-infernal-look-like?p=1392055#post1392055\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I guess the question comes back to this: What does this Infernal actually want to achieve? Why are they attacking this country? What's their goal?</div> </div> </div> </div>What I asked back in the very first reply.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-28T01:17:27-07:00","id":1392149,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2402_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2402\" data-vbnamecard=\"2402\">The Wizard of Oz</a><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar177_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"177\" data-vbnamecard=\"177\">TheCountAlucard</a><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/infernal-exalted/1390714-what-would-a-nation-state-under-attack-by-an-infernal-look-like?p=1390776#post1390776\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Brainstorm. Somewhat connected. Alternate reality has a megacorp that has taken over everything and is basically that horrible megacorporation you see in those sci-fi dystopias. Until one of their victims got an infernal exaltation while awaiting 're-education'. <br /> <br /> The girl's people were in indentured servitude, and used to be a bunch of natives owning land that the corp wanted. So now they're slaves, with their contracts signed in the name of the corporation. <br /> <br /> It took the girl a year to turn the corporation into dust and wind. This brainstorming is just for me to write down what she can potentially do to a nation-state that has pissed her off.</div> </div> </div> </div>Infernal is &quot;pissed off&quot;.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/infernal-exalted/1390714-what-would-a-nation-state-under-attack-by-an-infernal-look-like?p=1392055#post1392055\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A fair point, and I was perhaps being too simplistic.</div> </div> </div> </div>You can wish people into power and have them indebted to you. They don't know they're indebted until you come to collect.<br /> <br /> If there's some kind of parliamentary system, you don't need to call in all your markers at once. You don't call in a hundred chits telling all the senators to vote for the same Bill, you call in one chit telling one senator to make sure the Bill passes by any means neccessary.<br /> <br /> You can trade a chit in to get people to swear loyalty to you. They now have an Intimacy of terrified awe for you to exploit, and they know that if they ever betray you something bad will happen (but they don't know if that something is 2L or Final Viridescence).<br /> <br /> Or you just take your one favour. &quot;You are in office because of me, now make me Chancellor with Emergency Powers&quot;.<br /> <br /> It's not total, North Korea, control. But it's pretty much &quot;enough&quot; control. And okay, it's slightly more complex than you made it sound, but not much.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 05-28-2020, 04:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-28T07:20:04-07:00","id":1392188,"title":"","content":"\u201cThey pissed me off\u201d is not a sufficient answer. What I\u2019d do and the lengths I\u2019d go to do it in a fit of anger are entirely context dependent. <br /> <br /> Is the Infernal pissed off because of an oppressive militarized police force is unfairly targeting and killing people of her race, with no real checks and balances to reign them in?<br /> <br /> Is the Infernal pissed off because a government is lying about the availability of tests and PPE during a pandemic and encouraging people to risk their lives for the economy? <br /> <br /> Is the Infernal pissed because her country\u2019s head of state is demonstrating his lack of understanding of the laws he\u2019s sworn to uphold by promising to sanction a platform for fact-checking him? <br /> <br /> Is the Infernal pissed off because the so-called \u201cjustice\u201d department is engaging in open corruption to protect a criminal while simultaneously dragging its feet regarding classifying white nationalists who shoot up terrified Americans in a Walmart as the terrorists they are?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 05-28-2020, 10:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-28T08:35:39-07:00","id":1392203,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/infernal-exalted/1390714-what-would-a-nation-state-under-attack-by-an-infernal-look-like?p=1391619#post1391619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> We see what a modern democracy governed by people compromised by being beholden to the interests of others function like.<br /> <br /> Dangerous, but still stymied by courts, by parliaments, by watchdogs, by civil servants who unenthusiastically implement policies, by whistleblowers, and by protests of the people. The Infernals fight has only begun.<br /> <br /> Also, their payment can't take any longer than a month to provide, and has to be a single discrete task.</div> </div> </div> </div>It really depends who has narrative priority. <br /> There's a lot of ways to make this process far more difficult for the Infernal, but most Storytellers probably wouldn't do it to a PC facing purely mortal opposition. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-28T16:31:38-07:00","id":1392352,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/infernal-exalted/1390714-what-would-a-nation-state-under-attack-by-an-infernal-look-like?p=1392203#post1392203\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">most Storytellers probably wouldn't do it to a PC facing purely mortal opposition. <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Statements like this make me feel as though the Lunar Dominions chapter is a wasted effort. It is a disheartening feeling.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-29T02:49:00-07:00","id":1392460,"title":"","content":"Accelerator, this nation-state that's pissed off your hypothetical Infernal, is it one that your Infernal's people (who were enslaved) live in? Or just one that supported the megacorp, or bought the products the slaves produced? Or they've pissed her off in an unrelated way?<br /> And is she trying to go for some kind of poetic justice, a slow and methodical destruction of the nation, or is she just really angry and it's explosions and death everywhere? Or conquest?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-29T07:11:27-07:00","id":1392510,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/infernal-exalted/1390714-what-would-a-nation-state-under-attack-by-an-infernal-look-like?p=1392460#post1392460\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Accelerator, this nation-state that's pissed off your hypothetical Infernal, is it one that your Infernal's people (who were enslaved) live in? Or just one that supported the megacorp, or bought the products the slaves produced? Or they've pissed her off in an unrelated way?<br /> And is she trying to go for some kind of poetic justice, a slow and methodical destruction of the nation, or is she just really angry and it's explosions and death everywhere? Or conquest?</div> </div> </div> </div>one that supported the megacorp, and is one of the main pillars.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-30T04:16:52-07:00","id":1392779,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/infernal-exalted/1390714-what-would-a-nation-state-under-attack-by-an-infernal-look-like?p=1392352#post1392352\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Statements like this make me feel as though the Lunar Dominions chapter is a wasted effort. It is a disheartening feeling.</div> </div> </div> </div>Content like that is at its most useful when the PCs are allied with or initially ambivalent to those places. <br /> <br /> In a more general sense, mortal opposition to Exalted is limited and its greatest strength is that if the PCs become accustomed to getting their own way because they're throwing around huge social dice pools having someone go &quot;no, fuck you&quot; at a critical moment will resonate more strongly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}